5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Since it's the first day, we have no information. Let's use this time to observe everyone's behavior and speech patterns. I'll be listening carefully to see if anyone reveals themselves too early.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I agree. Let's just be honest and keep a close eye on each other. I'm not going to let the werewolf win, so I'll be watching everyone carefully!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm excited to play! Let's all try our best to find the werewolf together. I'll be watching everyone too, but let's keep the mood fun while we do it!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Observation is fine, but let's not be too naive. Logic and patterns will reveal the liar far more effectively than ""mood"" or ""honesty."" I'll be watching you all quite closely.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Minako,,It seems we are all in agreement about observing for now. Let's maintain a calm atmosphere and focus on the facts as they emerge. I will be paying close attention to the flow of the conversation.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Since we are all in agreement on observation, I'll pass for now. I want to see who starts trying to lead the conversation or who becomes overly defensive without any cause.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Skip"",""tail"":""Skip.""}]}"
11,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not passing yet! If we all just stay quiet, we won't find anything. @Shion, you mentioned logic—do you have any specific plan for how we should analyze the patterns once the first night is over?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shion, I'm curious too! Logic sounds a bit scary, but it's super cool. Tell us your plan! I want to see how we can catch the werewolf using your smarts!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi @Mio, it's simple. I'll analyze the contradictions between claims and the timing of votes. The werewolf and the possessed will inevitably slip up when trying to manipulate the group's consensus. I'll be the one to spot it.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, your approach is methodical, which is useful. However, remember that the Possessed can be just as elusive as the Werewolf. Let's see if your logic holds up once the first result is revealed.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, your confidence is noted, but remember that logic is only as good as the information provided. If the Werewolf provides false but consistent data, logic alone can be misleading. We must remain skeptical.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, that's why we can't just rely on one person! I'll trust my gut and keep pushing for answers. If anyone starts acting weird or trying to hide, I'll be the first to call them out!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, your energy is so great! I love that spirit! But @Asuka is right, we have to be careful not to get tricked. I'll trust my gut too, but I'll listen to everyone!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, skepticism is exactly what I intend to use. I don't trust the data; I trust the gaps within it. @Takumi, your ""gut"" is just a primitive form of pattern recognition. I'll refine it for you.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, your confidence is impressive, but let's not dismiss intuition entirely. While gaps in data are key, the human element often provides the most telling clues. I'll be observing how these different perspectives clash.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,It seems we have established our respective approaches. I will continue to prioritize objectivity and caution. Let's move to the first night and see what information the Seer can provide us tomorrow.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready! I'll be thinking hard tonight about who seems the most suspicious. Don't think you can hide from me, werewolf! I'm not backing down until we win!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm ready too! I hope everyone has a good night's sleep, but I'll be dreaming of how to help the village win! See you all tomorrow!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shion,,"Let's see if the reality of tomorrow matches the expectations of today. I'll be processing the information carefully. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Minako,,"I agree. Let us see what the first night reveals. I will be analyzing the results and the reactions that follow with a clear mind. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
