69,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Takumi was executed, and Shion was attacked. This is a critical development. The Werewolf targeted Shion, which strongly suggests Shion is human. If Shion were the Werewolf, they wouldn't attack themselves.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Oh no! Shion is gone too! That's so sad! @Asuka is right, though; the werewolf wouldn't attack Shion if Shion was the werewolf. Poor Shion... I feel terrible that I voted for them!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Minako,,"It is a regrettable outcome, but the facts are clear. Shion's death confirms their human status. We must now analyze why the Werewolf chose Shion and how that affects our perception of the remaining players.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"The Werewolf likely targeted Shion because Shion's logical approach was a threat. With Takumi and Shion gone, only three of us remain. If the Werewolf is among us, they only need one more kill to win. @Mio @Minako, any thoughts?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi"",""Mio"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, you're right, it's getting really scary now! I'm so nervous... @Minako, do you think the werewolf is one of us? I really want to find them so we can all be safe!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Mio, it is a mathematical certainty that the Werewolf is among us. With Shion and Takumi gone, the Werewolf must be either Asuka, Mio, or myself. We must remain calm to avoid a mistake.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion"",""Takumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, your logic is sound. Since we are down to three, the Werewolf must be here. @Mio, your nervousness is natural, but we need to be precise. If there is a Possessed, they are also among us. Who among us has been too quiet?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, I've been trying to help! I'm just really scared because we're so few now. @Minako has been very calm, but maybe that's just how she is? I don't want to guess wrong again!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Mio, my calmness is simply my nature. @Asuka, you asked who has been too quiet, but we have all spoken. The real question is who benefited most from the chaos between Takumi and Shion.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Asuka"",""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"The chaos between Takumi and Shion served as a perfect smokescreen. @Mio, you followed Takumi's lead to vote for Shion, yet you've remained consistently passive. @Minako, your analysis is precise, but perhaps too detached. I suspect one of you is the Werewolf.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion"",""Mio"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, that's so mean! I'm not being passive, I'm just really scared! I don't want to make another mistake like I did with Shion. I'm a villager, I promise! Please don't suspect me!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, suspecting me for being detached is a subjective judgment, not a fact. @Mio's fear is evident, but desperation can be a mask. Since we must vote, we should consider who is most likely the Werewolf.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
